50,3,1,talk,Midori,,"The candidates are Home Follow-Up, Day Rehab, Chronic Care, and Perinatal Support. I vote for Perinatal Support.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Given the data, Perinatal Support is the safest bet. I vote for that as well.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll vote for Perinatal Support; the staffing alignment is just too good to ignore.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Shion,,I vote for Perinatal Support. It avoids the funding traps of off-site work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Shizue,,I also vote for Perinatal Support. It's the least likely to seize up our facilities.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
